{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261119/photo/bkn-20261119071447420-1119_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261119072527\"/><p>深圳主辦APEC領導人非正式會議。（Getty Images圖片）</p><p>亞太經合組織（APEC）第33次領導人非正式會議周四（19日）將在深圳福田香蜜湖的深圳國際交流中心舉行，會議主題為「建設亞太共同體，促進共同繁榮」。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T23:44:24.267606+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T23:14:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T00:37:31.724395+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T23:37:51.873119+00:00","content_hash":"7790298d23acad3816eb140eaa59b5fe1b0c0365adb95f9424dbc3db8b2d362f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}